OL,3,ABody of missing runner found in South
OL,4,AAfrica
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said they were not linking the
OL,7,Fdeaths to a serial killer but added
OL,8,Fthat the "similarities are sufficiently
OL,9,Fconcerning... to issue a public
OL,10,Fwarning".
OL,12,FA jogger who knew Moselakgomo through
OL,13,Ftheir running club told the BBC the
OL,14,Fdiscovery of the five bodies was "very
OL,15,Fscary".
